Subject: [PATCH 69/69] freedreno: report 32 texture instructions/indirections
 on Xenos

ir2 records at most 64 fetches per shader; ARB_fragment_program reported
16384, and fp-indirections2 built a 64+ fetch chain that overran
fetch_info[] (free(): invalid pointer). fp-indirections and
fp-indirections2 pass.

Generated-by: LLM
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
